        "original_id": "431d6732-598f-5151-9e9d-380ec543fa4b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Heath Ledger, Ang Lee, Diana Ossana, James Schamus, Conor O'Sullivan\n- Films: Brokeback Mountain, The Dark Knight\n- Characters: The Joker\n- Roles: actor, director, makeup artist\n\nFacts:\n- Heath Ledger was born on 4 April 1979 and died on 22 January 2008.\n- Heath Ledger was an Australian actor and director.\n- Brokeback Mountain is a 2005 American neo-western romantic drama film.\n- Brokeback Mountain was directed by Ang Lee and produced by Diana Ossana and James Schamus.\n- In The Dark Knight, The Joker was portrayed by Heath Ledger.\n- Conor O'Sullivan is a British prosthetic makeup artist.\n- Conor O'Sullivan was nominated for two Academy Awards.\n- Conor O'Sullivan is best known as one of the makeup artists on The Dark Knight who helped create The Joker's makeup.",
